On p2180 sdmmc4 is powered from a fixed 1.8 V regulator.

Signed-off-by: Aapo Vienamo <avienamo@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Mikko Perttunen <mperttunen@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Thierry Reding <treding@nvidia.com>
